U|                         pictures were cool, but... a DOOR?                         
U|                         I will say it again. A door.                               
U|                         Zzzzzzzzzzzzzzz...                                         
O|
N|               Jesse lets out a fake SNORE, but he still doesn’t get under          
N|               her skin.                                                            
O|
C|                                   JANE                                             
U|                         Why not a door? Sometimes you get                          
U|                         fixated on something, and you might                        
U|                         not even get why. You open                                 
U|                         yourself up and go with the flow...                        
U|                         wherever the universe takes you.                           
N|               Jesse sighs, he’s not going to win this one. He puts his             
N|               keys in the ignition and starts the car.                             
O|
C|                                   JESSE                                            
U|                         Okay, so... the universe took her                          
U|                         to a door. She got all obsessed                            
U|                         with it and just had to paint it                           
U|                         twenty times until it was perfect.                         
