N|               Jane shakes her head -- not quite.                                   
C|                                   JANE                                             
U|                         No.  I wouldn’t say that.                                  
U|                         Nothing’s perfect.                                         
O|
N|               Jesse studies her and smiles.                                        
O|
C|                                   JESSE                                            
